      "finalResponse": "All green (`go test ./...`, `go vet`, `gofmt` clean).\n\nProduction change for the gate: refactored `cmd/matrixd/main.go` so `main` delegates to a new `run(getenv func(string) string, listen func(string, http.Handler) error) error`. Behavior is unchanged (`MATRIX_SIZE`/`MATRIX_FILL`/`MATRIX_ADDR`, default `:8080`), but the startup path is now unit-testable without binding a port or calling `os.Exit`.\n\nTests added to kill the reported survivors:\n- `%w` wrap checks via `errors.Is(err, strconv.ErrSyntax/ErrRange)` for rows, cols, and fill.\n- Base/bit-size: `\"19\"` (kills base 10→9/11), `\"2000000000\"` and `\"3000000000\"` (kills bitSize 32→31/33).\n- `run` tests: default addr, `MATRIX_ADDR` override, handler-construction error short-circuit, and listen-error propagation.",
